  epo:hasAdditionalInformation """This prior information notice announces the intention of the contracting authority to publish a future call for tenders. No other information or documents are available at this stage. Interested economic operators are invited to subscribe at the link https://ec.europa.eu/info/funding-tenders/opportunities/portal/screen/opportunities/tender-details/af614f08-1675-4225-8bc9-2aedfca2350a-PIN in order to get notified when the contract notice and all the procurement documents, including the tender specifications, are published.
"""@en;
  epo:hasInternalIdentifier <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/1b9e5ca3-2214-4742-aede-65c2d178aee0-01/PlannedProcurement/Identifier/HR%2F2023%2FOP%2F0313-PIN>;
  epo:hasLegalBasis <http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/legal-basis/32018R1046>;
  epo:hasPurpose <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/1b9e5ca3-2214-4742-aede-65c2d178aee0-01/ProcedurePurpose$_PriorInformationNotice1_ProcurementProject1>;
  epo:isSubjectToTerm <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/1b9e5ca3-2214-4742-aede-65c2d178aee0-01/ProcessPlanningTerm$_PriorInformationNotice1_PlannedDate1>;
  dct:description """The call for tenders concerns the provision of training and e-learning services to the EU Institutions and more than 50 other Bodies and Agencies of the European Union.
It will be divided into 6 lots:
Lot 1	European and international affairs, EU governance and policymaking
Lot 2	Human Resources (HR)
Lot 3	Negotiation (for EU Negotiation professionals)
Lot 4	Communication (for EU Communication professionals)
Lot 5	Finance, accounting, fraud prevention, internal and external control & audit
Lot 6	 Media content development"""@en;
  dct:title "Learning and Development Services for staff of the Institutions, Bodies and Agencies (IBAs) of the European Union"@en .

